{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1544923-i-m-writing-a-fanfic-on-a-hunter-s-imbuing-but-i-can-t-decide-on-the-scenario","id":1544923,"title":"I'm writing a fanfic on a Hunter's Imbuing, but I can't decide on the scenario","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-28T14:03:23-07:00","id":1544923,"title":"I'm writing a fanfic on a Hunter's Imbuing, but I can't decide on the scenario","content":"The character was an ex-marine recon turned SWAT Officer I can't decide whether his team raids a Sabbat lair or has an encounter with a crazy Red Talon in the suburbs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T14:13:46-07:00","id":1544924,"title":"","content":"The former is generally more straightforward carnage where you might end up giving as good as you get even before the Imbuing (shovelheads can stand up to gunshots well, but if your character has, say, a mislabeled incendiary from the armory or accidentally hits fuel or gas, that can be sidestepped and give the character an idea about how to live long enough to hear the Messengers). The latter would likely start with a case of mistaken identity in an investigation, as the Red Talons have a Gift that allows them to change claw and bite marks to look like knife and gunshot wounds; any crime scenes that one leaves behind are going to look bonkers and have a lot of conflicting evidence, even if the forensics tends to point toward humans killing humans because no one is going to think that a wolf uses a knife or a gun. You can use the presence of &quot;undone&quot; artificial objects as a line of evidence pointing the reader in the right direction for the mystery if you're doing a slower burn. And by &quot;undone&quot; I mean mysterious piles of raw components next to where tools or small vehicles were placed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T14:44:50-07:00","id":1544927,"title":"","content":"Well, SWAT are typically armed with shotguns, automatic weapons and high-caliber sniper rifles. They also have access to plastic explosives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 10-28-2024, 05:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T15:32:43-07:00","id":1544930,"title":"","content":"Plastique is probably going to be used primarily for breaching operations, so if the shovelheads are out in the open, it's not likely to get carried along in great quantities. The primary weapons used are going to be things that vampires are highly resistance to, barring head shots (maybe), so the squad is going to be dealing with ludicrously resilient shock troops before the real threat even arises. The shovelheads' handler might even dominate someone into using up as much of the explosives supply as possibly on said shovelheads because, well, that is what said shovelheads are there for - drawing fire and distracting defenders from the actual targets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T15:52:32-07:00","id":1544932,"title":"","content":"Well, from what I've heard heavy firearms like shotguns, rifles and machine guns are more effective against Cainites than pistols. I was also thinking that besides the vampires there might be a few ghouls as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-28T16:51:27-07:00","id":1544941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1544923-i-m-writing-a-fanfic-on-a-hunter-s-imbuing-but-i-can-t-decide-on-the-scenario?p=1544932#post1544932\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, from what I've heard heavy firearms like shotguns, rifles and machine guns are more effective against Cainites than pistols. I was also thinking that besides the vampires there might be a few ghouls as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not unless the ST says so. You'd have to get up around BMG before you can start ignoring some of their resilience vs. guns. Maybe if you load a shotgun with slugs, the shotgun can also do that, but that's conspicuously noticeable if it hits something else...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T05:42:11-08:00","id":1545386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1544923-i-m-writing-a-fanfic-on-a-hunter-s-imbuing-but-i-can-t-decide-on-the-scenario?p=1544941#post1544941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not unless the ST says so. You'd have to get up around BMG before you can start ignoring some of their resilience vs. guns. Maybe if you load a shotgun with slugs, the shotgun can also do that, but that's conspicuously noticeable if it hits something else...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, rifles and machine guns will be more effective simply because they'll have bigger calibers and there will be plenty more bullets flying around, but the shovelheads will have the same resistance to it nevertheless","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus","name":"Magus Maximus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-05T09:36:09-08:00","id":1545393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magus Maximus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1544923-i-m-writing-a-fanfic-on-a-hunter-s-imbuing-but-i-can-t-decide-on-the-scenario?p=1545386#post1545386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, rifles and machine guns will be more effective simply because they'll have bigger calibers and there will be plenty more bullets flying around, but the shovelheads will have the same resistance to it nevertheless</div> </div> </div> </div>Once you reach .50 BMG, you're definitely in the realm where the bullets aren't just popping the fluid in living peoples' cavities, they're passing through solid stone and tearing bodies apart outright, living or dead. So I wouldn't necessarily say that licks still had resistance to higher bore diameters and lengthier cartridges by default; that might be a great idea for a Fortitude power, but not something that recent mass-embraces from the thinnest possible blooded members of the Sabbat are getting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-21T04:03:03-08:00","id":1546237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1544923-i-m-writing-a-fanfic-on-a-hunter-s-imbuing-but-i-can-t-decide-on-the-scenario#post1544923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The character was an ex-marine recon turned SWAT Officer I can't decide whether his team raids a Sabbat lair or has an encounter with a crazy Red Talon in the suburbs.</div> </div> </div> </div>It depends on what you want to do, invading a Sabbat lair would imply a story more focused on a silent war between SWAT and the Sabbat that can unfold in several ways depending on the kindred present, in the case of Red Talon, if it isn't just an introduction, it would be a game of cat and mouse, as Red Talon would have an objective within the city and SWAT would hunt him down before he completed it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-21T07:59:40-08:00","id":1546244,"title":"","content":"Well, I was thinking the Swat raid would be in the wake of a series of murders or kidnappings and the police happen to track the perpetrator to a certain location. They're more or less in the dark about the true nature of what's going on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-21T08:42:45-08:00","id":1546245,"title":"","content":"The cops would probably not have an easy time of actually finding the Red Talon, since Hidden Killer means all the wounds on their victims would look like knife or gunshot wounds. They'd be looking for someone with guns and knives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-07T01:22:46-07:00","id":1549900,"title":"","content":"What exactly is Red Talon? Any sources to learn more?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26060-nuhxnger36","name":"NuHxnger36","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-07T17:56:30-07:00","id":1549932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NuHxnger36</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1544923-i-m-writing-a-fanfic-on-a-hunter-s-imbuing-but-i-can-t-decide-on-the-scenario?p=1549900#post1549900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What exactly is Red Talon?</div> </div> </div> </div>A tribe of Garou; close to the photo-negative of the Glass Walkers (no homids, everyone not Crinos-born is lupus).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Any sources to learn more? </div> </div> </div>Any given W:tA core. Best results is Revised and W20.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-10T17:26:22-07:00","id":1550017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1544923-i-m-writing-a-fanfic-on-a-hunter-s-imbuing-but-i-can-t-decide-on-the-scenario?p=1549932#post1549932\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A tribe of Garou; close to the photo-negative of the Glass Walkers (no homids, everyone not Crinos-born is lupus).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Any given W:tA core. Best results is Revised and W20.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cheers for that, mate!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26060-nuhxnger36","name":"NuHxnger36","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-10T08:02:11-08:00","id":1555312,"title":"","content":"I even came up with a profile for the character for fun.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Curtis Johnson-an Ex-marine recon turned Police Officer, after an encounter with the Sabbat he became a Judge.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Abilities: strength 3, dexterity 3, stamina 3, charisma 3, manipulation 2, appearance 2, perception (intuitive) 4, intelligence 3 and wits 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Attributes: alertness 3, athletics 3, brawl 2, dodge 2, empathy 3, intimidation 3, streetwise 1, drive 3, firearms 4, leadership 3, melee 2, police procedure 3, stealth 3, survival 4, investigation 2, law 2, medicine 2, science 2 and military science 2</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-10T15:44:32-08:00","id":1555336,"title":"","content":"Is your group not using the 20th anniversary Ability list? If that were the case, you could fold your Dodge dots into Athletics and get a higher Streetwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-10T18:59:20-08:00","id":1555345,"title":"","content":"Well, I haven't really gotten 20th yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}